        "# Generator\n",
        "\n",
        "A generator is an iterator produced by a generator function or generator expression. It yields values on demand while retaining its suspended execution state.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-generator)"
